--- stderr
No write needed: unplug the pad, hold R2 (RT) (only that button) and plug it back in; it starts in Keyboard mode and keeps it.
In profile 2 (SilkSong), R2 is the key Default calls B4 (Y).
Or switch it to web-config: hold S2 (Start) while plugging the pad in, or hold S2+B3+B4 (Start+X+Y) for 4 seconds while it runs (only those buttons).
In profile 2 (SilkSong), S2+B3+B4 are the keys Default calls S2 (Start), B3 (X) and R1 (RB).
Key names come from what gamepadii read on 2026-10-17T16:57:03Z; if the active profile changed since, they may be off.
